        "sm_unsupported"
      ],
      "explanation": "An NVFP4 MoE parametrisation with no SM90 backend: the resolver turns down TRTLLMGenFusedMoE and CutlassFusedMoE with sm_unsupported and the test carries no SM100 skip guard. Neither the resolver nor either backend is touched by this bring-up. iteration 31 pristine probe: the DeepSeek-V4 production diff was stashed, leaving the tree at fe4aebfe0f, and this test failed there with the same message; the working tree was then restored byte-identically (git diff sha256 e7b554b77ac53df24b6106b050637cd6877dada61124f0ba6879d57a9e66a5f5 before and after). Log: /cache/dsv4_flash_h100/iter31/pristine_two.log",
      "id": "nvfp4_moe_has_no_sm90_implementation"
